# MolRS provides both the folded Python package (molpy/) and the WASM
# package (molwasm/). setup-partners checks it out at ../molrs; Python's
# uv source and core's npm dependency use that same checkout. molpy gets
# mollog and molcfg from PyPI, not additional sibling repositories.
#
# KEY=VALUE lines only. Each ref is used exactly as declared. This batch
# pins the local unified API. This SHA must be pushed to MolCrafts/molrs
# before a fresh CI checkout can resolve it. No branch override is used.
#
# python/uv.lock records the partners' package metadata (version and
# dependencies), not a commit. When a partner's dev changes that metadata,
# `uv lock --check` fails; relock in a commit of its own.
#
# The npm package is built from this same source before npm install.
SELF=molvis
CI_PROFILE=node-python
MOLRS_REPOSITORY=MolCrafts/molrs
MOLRS_REF=f65ac315ed238b452e61be499d4e35dbf52bb9e4
CI_REF=f5d3606fab87fc162271c94219dbdc5201dd1aab
